 to your request for a prepaid by credit card package, you will find detailed information on the services below. Please read the contents carefully and mark the box which will appear at the time of purchase that says 'I have received the information form, read and accepted it' to continue. You may call the 444 0 375 Customer Services line for all necessary support. We thank you for choosing TTNET Wi-Fi.",pre_info_no_2:"TTNET Wi-Fi INFORMATION FORM",pre_info_no_2_p1:"With TTNET Wi-Fi you can freely connect to the Internet outside of your home and office, through thousands of service locations that provide this service, with your laptop or Wi-Fi compatible mobile phone.",pre_info_no_2_p2:"You may use your TTNET Wi-Fi prepaid package starting with the first time you use it until the end of the term for which it is valid.",pre_info_no_2_p3:"In order to connect to the Internet using TTNET Wi-Fi, there are several packages according to different frames of time that you can purchase at TTNET Wi-Fi service locations with your credit card.",pre_info_no_2_p4:"The TTNET Wi-Fi chosen prepaid package:",pre_info_no_2_p5:"of use, is valid for 1 day starting at the time of use, is a TTNET Wi-Fi service component for one time use, the fee(including taxes) is",pre_info_no_2_p6:"To connect to TTNET Wi-Fi:",pre_info_no_2_p7:"Turn on your device's Wi-Fi feature at an Internet service location where you see the TTNET Wi-Fi name and logo.",pre_info_no_2_p8:'Select the "TTNET Wi-Fi" from the wireless networks options (SSID).',pre_info_no_2_p9:"When you enter any web browser that is loaded on your computer you will automatically be directed to the entry page.",pre_info_no_2_p10:"You can start using TTNET Wi-Fi by entering your User Name and Password here.",pre_info_no_2_p11:"You can access a list of the TTNET Wi-Fi service locations under the TTNET Wi-Fi service locations menu on the www.ttnetWi-Fi.com.tr web page.",pre_info_no_2_p12:"For more detailed information on TTNET please",pre_info_no_2_p13:"You can also obtain more information on TTNET Wi-Fi by calling the 444 0 375 TTNET Customer Services, or stopping by your nearest Türk Telekom Office.",pre_info_no_2_p14:"Information You Should Know About TTNET Wi-Fi",pre_info_no_2_p15:"The products/services you will purchase are available as online sales paid with a credit card. A printed invoice for the service fees mentioned above will be sent to the postal address given in the request, if a request is made at the time of the online purchase. Because the process will be prepaid by credit card payment there is no need to pay the invoice as well. All increases or decreases in fees affected by economic or legal changes during the purchase process of products/services, including price changes that occur as the result of other economic factors will be reflected in the price lists. TTNET always owns the right to change prices without need for prior notification, without being limited to these reasons.",pre_info_no_2_p16:"You may use this package as a prepaid package.",pre_info_no_2_p17:"The TTNET Wi-Fi Prepaid Packages may be used by anyone, regardless of whether or not they are a TTNET customer, to have access to TTNET Wi-Fi Wireless Internet.",pre_info_no_2_p18:"The packages purchased after paying a one time fee, may be used in the time allotted to access the Internet at TTNET Wi-Fi service locations.",pre_info_no_2_p19:"This service is not subject to a physical delivery. You may have access to the services you have purchased using the user name and password you established at the time of purchase.",pre_info_no_2_p20:"TTNET Wi-Fi Prepaid Packages are a service provided by TTNET A.Ş. which is located at Esentepe Mahallesi, Salih Tozan Sokak, No:16, Karamancılar İŞ Merkezi, D Blok, 34394, Şişli/İstanbul, telephone number 0 212 306 10 00. You may forward all questions, requests and complaints to the address detailed above as well as by calling the TTNET Customer Service line at 0 212 444 0 375. You may also submit your complaints and objections that are within the financial limits as defined by the Ministry every December, to the consumer arbitration committee or court in the location where the purchase was made or your legal residence area.",tiklayiniz:"click..."},sales_agg:{sales_agg_header:"PRE-NOTIFICATION FORM AND DISTANT SALES AGREEMENT",sayin:"Dear",unvani:"TITLE",mernis_no:"CRS NO",adres:"ADDRESS",telefon:"PHONE",gsm_no:"GSM NO",fax:"Fax",web_adresi:"Web-Site",eposta:"E-MAIL ADDRESS",package_name:"PACKAGE NAME",tl:"TRY",pre_paid:"Pre-paid,",package_characteristics:"PACKAGE CHARACTERISTICS",package_fee:"PACKAGE FEE",date:"Date:",musteri_hizmetleri:"Customer Services",sales_agg_no_1:"1-PARTIES",sales_agg_no_1_1:"OPERATOR/SELLER INFORMATION",sales_agg_no_1_2:"SUBSCRIBER/PURCHASER INFORMATION:",sales_agg_no_1_3:"1.3 PRODUCTS/SERVICE(S) AND FEATURES",sales_agg_no_1_3_p1:"The BUYER has purchased the products for which the features are specified in this Contract herein and the TTNET Wi-Fi Information Form. The features and conditions for use of the product/service purchased are as described on the http://www.ttnet.com.tr/ web site's product/service introductory page and the TTNET Wi-Fi Information Form which is an inseparable part of this Contract herein.",sales_agg_no_2:"2. SUBJECT MATTER OF THE PRE-NOTIFICATION FORM AND DISTANT SALES AGREEMENT",sales_agg_no_2_p1:"Subject matter of this Pre-Notification Form and Distant Sales Agreement (FORM) is to set out the rights and obligations of the parties in accordance with the provisions of the Law No. 6502 on Consumer Protection and Regulation on Distance Contracts regarding the sales and delivery of the service provided/sold by the OPERATOR to the PURCHASER for which specifications and sales price are detailed below. ",sales_agg_no_3:"3. BASIC CHARACTERISTICS AND PRICE OF THE PRODUCT OR SERVICE",sales_agg_no_3_p1:"Package name, sales price including VAT-Special Communication Tax and basic characteristics as the subject of the FORM are detailed below.",sales_agg_no_3_p2:"The Purchaser shall be able to connect to the Internet at thousands of relevant service points outside his/her home and workplace via their laptops, tablets or WiFi-compatible mobile phones with the Türk Telekom WiFi. ",sales_agg_no_3_p3:"The Purchaser can use the selected Türk Telekom WiFi pre-paid package from the first use until the end of the validity period of the package.",sales_agg_no_3_p4:"To connect to Türk Telekom WiFi:",sales_agg_no_3_p5:"The Purchaser must turn on the wifi feature of the device at the wireless internet service point where Türk Telekom WiFi name and logo appear and choose “Türk Telekom WiFi” from the available wifi networks (SSID).  The Purchaser shall enter the User Name and Password information or complete the verification processes on the welcome page and start using Türk Telekom WiFi. ",sales_agg_no_3_p6_1:"You can get more information about the features and terms of use of the purchased product/service at ",sales_agg_no_3_p6_2:"",sales_agg_no_4:"4. PAYMENT AND DELIVERY:",sales_agg_no_4_p1:"Once the PURCHASER reads the information about the service purchased and confirms this FORM, the service sale shall be completed. Subsequently, the purchased service shall be defined at the time of request and the PURCHASER shall be able to use the service based on the identification without the need for any further action.",sales_agg_no_4_p2:"The purchased service shall not be delivered in any physical form.",sales_agg_no_4_p3:"Fee for the product or service subject to the form shall be collected by credit card via payment service providers operating within the framework of the relevant law. In the event that the service fee subject to the FORM is not paid for any reason and/or it is canceled in the records of the bank, financial institution, the OPERATOR/SELLER’s obligation to deliver/perform the Service/Product subject to the FORM shall expire.",sales_agg_no_4_p4:"The invoice of the package fee in this form shall be submitted to the PURCHASER’s contact address.",sales_agg_no_5:"5. RIGHT OF WITHDRAWAL",sales_agg_no_5_p1:"As the package subject to this form is within the scope of services that are carried out instantly electronically in accordance with the Articles 15 (ğ) and (h) of the Law on Consumer Protection No. 6502 and Regulation on Distance Contracts and/or started to be performed with the consent of the consumer before the expiry of the right of withdrawal, the Purchaser/consumer has no right of withdrawal.",sales_agg_no_6:"6. SOLUTION MECHANISM FOR CUSTOMER COMPLAINTS:",sales_agg_no_6_p1:"Queries, requests and complaints about the purchased product/tariff/package/transaction/service can be directed to the above address or to Türk Telekom Customer Service at 444 1 444.",sales_agg_no_6_p2:"Applications for complaints and objections can be made to the Consumer Arbitration Committee or the Consumer Court in the place where the product or service is purchased or resident, within the monetary limits announced by the Ministry of Commerce in December each year.",sales_agg_no_7:"7. PERSONAL DATA PROTECTION",sales_agg_no_7_p1:"The OPERATOR accepts, declares and undertakes that it is obliged to act in accordance with all regulations, rules and principles in force regarding the protection of Personal Data, particularly Article 51 of the Electronic Communications Law No. 5809, Law on the Protection of Personal Data No. 6698 (“KVKK”) and secondary regulations and Board decisions and guidelines. In terms of all its activities related to the processing of personal data obtained from the PURCHASER or obtained on behalf of the other party during the performance of this Agreement, the OPERATOR accepts, declares and undertakes that it shall be subject to all kinds of the current national legislation in the field of personal data protection, in particular KVKK, and shall have statutory liability to comply with this legislation in transaction processes. In addition, it agrees, declares and undertakes that it shall also comply with the principles set forth in the Board Decisions and Guidelines to be published by the Personal Data Protection Board ('Board') within the scope of personal data legislation.",sales_agg_no_7_p2:"PURCHASER agrees to the collection, processing and use of her/his Personal Data for statistical, administrative and accounting purposes to the extent that it is necessary for the OPERATOR to provide services, as well as conducting research on the market, behaviors and preferences, marketing activities such as advertising, targeted advertising, campaigns, offers, gifts, promotions, publicity, celebrations, prizes, lottery, and diversification of products and services, performance measurement/rating operations, conducting business development and communication activities, adapting the OPERATOR's presentation to the expectations of the PURCHASERS, increasing the quality of services, creating a collective image for PURCHASERS and advertising.",sales_agg_no_7_p3:"All these Personal Data belonging to PURCHASER shall be processed, stored and used for the purposes specified in the Clarification Text in accordance with the Personal Data Protection Law, the relevant regulations and, in any case, the Clarification Text on the OPERATOR's Website",sales_agg_no_8:"8. MISCELLANEOUS",sales_agg_no_8_p1:"This FORM is an integral part and annex to the Agreement (End-User License Agreement) regarding the service subject to the FORM. For matters not specified in the FORM, the provisions of the Agreement shall be considered valid and the provisions of the Agreement shall be applicable in terms of disputes arising from the implementation of the FORM.",sales_agg_no_8_p2:"This Form has been read, accepted and confirmed by the parties electronically, and the provisions of the Consumer Protection Law No. 6502 and the relevant legislation shall be apply to the matters specified in the Form.",sales_agg_no_8_p3:"THE PURCHASER ACCEPTS, DECLARES AND UNDERTAKES THAT HE/SHE HAS READ THE FORM AS PER THE ARTICLE 48 OF THE LAW NO. 6502 AND HAS GIVEN THE NECESSARY CONFIRMATION IN THE ELECTRONIC ENVIRONMENT.",sales_agg_no_8_p4:"Upon the approval of the FORM, the PURCHASER shall be deemed to have approved the start of the service by accepting all the conditions of the contract, and the FORM shall enter into force on the date of approval and shall result in payment obligation. ",sales_agg_no_9:"ARTICLE 9: THE ENDING AND TERMINATION OF THE CONTRACT",sales_agg_no_9_p1:"This Contract which is affected by the purchase of the service by BUYER and mutual compliance of both sides with the given obligations is ended with the completion of the service term. The SELLER may at any time terminate the Contract without any allowance of time if the BUYER does not carry out their obligations  that are generated by the Contract and as detailed in the TTNET Wi-Fi Information Form and the TTNET Final User License Contract. Also the SELLER may, depending on changes in the working model, unilaterally decide to discontinue providing the product(s)/service(s) that are the subject of this Contract and cease the service.  Separately from this, the BUYER will always have the right to terminate the Contract according to Article 8.",sales_agg_no_10:"ARTICLE 10: AUTHORIZED COURTS",sales_agg_no_10_p1:"Istanbul (Central) Courts are authorized in any disputes caused by this Contract. Also the BUYER shall be able to submit complaints and objections about products or services within the monetary value that is specified by the Ministry every December, to the arbitration committee or consumer court in their area of residence or the area in which the purchase was made.",sales_agg_no_11:"ARTICLE 11: VALIDITY",sales_agg_no_11_p1:"This Contract herein covers services that are instantly executed. When the Contract has been read and confirmed by the BUYER in writing on electronic format, the BUYER will be accepted as committed to all of the conditions in the 