rices changed subject to any increase or decrease in costs and other economic factors arisen from the economic changes or legal amendments in supply process of the products and/or services you will purchase shall be reflected to the price lists. TTNET shall be entitled to make change in the price list anytime at advance notice including but not limited to those.",pre_info_no_2_p16:"Bu servisten ön ödemeli bir paket alarak faydalanabilirsiniz.",pre_info_no_2_p17:"Turk Telekom WIFI Prepaid Packages are the packages which all the users whether or not TTNET Subscriber may use to take advantage of Turk Telekom WIFI Wireless Internet access service.",pre_info_no_2_p18:"Internet access can be provided by the packages purchased at the price paid for once only for prescribed time period at Turk Telekom WIFI service points.",pre_info_no_2_p19:"There is no physical delivery of this service.  You may get access to the service you purchased with the user name and password you assigned at the time you applied.",pre_info_no_2_p20:"The products/services you purchased are in the scope of the services for which no right of withdrawal can be exercised pursuant to the Customer Protection Law No. 6502 and items (g) and (h) of Article 15 of the Distant Agreements Regulation.",pre_info_no_2_p21:"Turk Telekom WIFI Prepaid Packages are the services supplied by TTNET A.S. and Mersis number of TTNET A.S. is : 0859049187200014, its address: Gayrettepe Mahallesi Vefa Bayırı Sokak No:2 Kat:3 Beşiktaş/İstanbul; telephone number 0 212 306 10 00. You may convey your queries, complaints and objections to aforementioned address as well as you may call the Customer Services number 0 212 444 0 145. In addition, within the limits set by the Ministry in December of every year, you may file your applications regarding your complaints and objections with the arbitration committee for customer problems or the customer court located at the region where you purchased the good or service or where you domicile. ",tiklayiniz:"click here..."},sales_agg_iga:{sales_agg_header:"PRE-NOTIFICATION FORM AND DISTANT SALES AGREEMENT",sayin:"Dear",unvani:"TITLE",mernis_no:"CRS NO",adres:"ADDRESS",telefon:"PHONE",gsm_no:"GSM NO",eposta:"E-MAIL ADDRESS",package_name:"PACKAGE NAME",package_characteristics:"PACKAGE CHARACTERISTICS",package_fee:"PACKAGE FEE",tl:"TRY",euro:"EURO",pre_paid:"Pre-paid,",date:"Date:",pasaport:"PASSPORT NO",sales_agg_no_1:"1-PARTIES",sales_agg_no_1_1:"OPERATOR/SELLER INFORMATION",sales_agg_no_1_2:"SUBSCRIBER/PURCHASER INFORMATION:",sales_agg_no_2:"2. SUBJECT MATTER OF THE PRE-NOTIFICATION FORM AND DISTANT SALES AGREEMENT",sales_agg_no_2_p1:"Subject matter of this Pre-Notification Form and Distant Sales Agreement (FORM) is to set out the rights and obligations of the parties in accordance with the provisions of the Law No. 6502 on Consumer Protection and Regulation on Distance Contracts regarding the sales and delivery of the service provided/sold by the OPERATOR to the PURCHASER for which specifications and sales price are detailed below.",sales_agg_no_3:"3. BASIC CHARACTERISTICS AND PRICE OF THE PRODUCT OR SERVICE",sales_agg_no_3_p1:"Package name, sales price including VAT-Special Communication Tax and basic characteristics as the subject of the FORM are detailed below. ",sales_agg_no_3_p2:"In order to connect to Türk Telekom WiFi, the wifi feature of the device must be turned on at the wireless internet service point where Türk Telekom WiFi name and logo appear and “Istanbul AirportTurkTelekomFree” must be chosen from the available wifi networks (SSID). Following the selection, when attempting to navigate to any page in the web browser installed on the computer or mobile phone, automatic redirection shall be made to the welcome page.  The Purchaser clicks “Login with SMS” on the page that opens, selects the flag for the country code, enters the phone number, confirms the terms of use and clicks “Get SMS Code” and enters the code/password sent to the mobile phone to start using the package. The Purchaser may also get the password by having his/her passport swiped at Wi-Fi Kiosks.  The Purchaser clicks “Login with Kiosk Password”, enters the passport number and the password received from the kiosk, and confirms the terms of use to start using the package.",sales_agg_no_3_p3:"The Purchaser can use the selected package from the first use until the end of the validity period of the package.",sales_agg_no_4:"4. PAYMENT AND DELIVERY:",sales_agg_no_4_p1:"Once the PURCHASER reads the information about the service purchased and confirms this FORM, the service sale shall be completed. Subsequently, the purchased service shall be defined at the time of request and the PURCHASER shall be able to use the service based on the identification without the need for any further action.",sales_agg_no_4_p2:"The purchased service shall not be delivered in any physical form.",sales_agg_no_4_p3:"Fee for the product or service subject to the form shall be collected by credit card via payment service providers operating within the framework of the relevant law. In the event that the service fee subject to the FORM is not paid for any reason and/or it is canceled in the records of the bank, financial institution, the OPERATOR/SELLER’s obligation to deliver/perform the Service/Product subject to the FORM shall expire.",sales_agg_no_4_p4:"The invoice of the package fee in this form shall be submitted to the PURCHASER’s contact address.",sales_agg_no_5:"5. RIGHT OF WITHDRAWAL",sales_agg_no_5_p1:"As the package subject to this form is within the scope of services that are carried out instantly electronically in accordance with the Articles 15 (ğ) and (h) of the Law on Consumer Protection No. 6502 and Regulation on Distance Contracts and/or started to be performed with the consent of the consumer before the expiry of the right of withdrawal, the Purchaser/consumer has no right of withdrawal.",sales_agg_no_6:"6. SOLUTION MECHANISM FOR CUSTOMER COMPLAINTS:",sales_agg_no_6_p1:"Queries, requests and complaints about the purchased product/tariff/package/transaction/service can be directed to the above address or to Türk Telekom Customer Service at 444 0 145.",sales_agg_no_6_p2:"Applications for complaints and objections can be made to the Consumer Arbitration Committee or the Consumer Court in the place where the product or service is purchased or resident, within the monetary limits announced by the Ministry of Commerce in December each year.",sales_agg_no_7:"7. PERSONAL DATA PROTECTION",sales_agg_no_7_p1:"The OPERATOR accepts, declares and undertakes that it is obliged to act in accordance with all regulations, rules and principles in force regarding the protection of Personal Data, particularly Article 51 of the Electronic Communications Law No. 5809, Law on the Protection of Personal Data No. 6698 (“KVKK”) and secondary regulations and Board decisions and guidelines. In terms of all its activities related to the processing of personal data obtained from the PURCHASER or obtained on behalf of the other party during the performance of this Agreement, the OPERATOR accepts, declares and undertakes that it shall be subject to all kinds of the current national legislation in the field of personal data protection, in particular KVKK, and shall have statutory liability to comply with this legislation in transaction processes. In addition, it agrees, declares and undertakes that it shall also comply with the principles set forth in the Board Decisions and Guidelines to be published by the Personal Data Protection Board ('Board') within the scope of personal data legislation.",sales_agg_no_7_p2:"PURCHASER agrees to the collection, processing and use of her/his Personal Data for statistical, administrative and accounting purposes to the extent that it is necessary for the OPERATOR to provide services, as well as conducting research on the market, behaviors and preferences, marketing activities such as advertising, targeted advertising, campaigns, offers, gifts, promotions, publicity, celebrations, prizes, lottery, and diversification of products and services, performance measurement/rating operations, conducting business development and communication activities, adapting the OPERATOR's presentation to the expectations of the PURCHASERS, increasing the quality of services, creating a collective image for PURCHASERS and advertising.",sales_agg_no_7_p3:"All these Personal Data belonging to PURCHASER shall be processed, stored and used for the purposes specified in the Clarification Text in accordance with the Personal Data Protection Law, the relevant regulations and, in any case, the Clarification Text on the OPERATOR's Website",sales_agg_no_8:"8. MISCELLANEOUS",sales_agg_no_8_p1:"This FORM is an integral part and annex to the Agreement (End-User License Agreement) regarding the service subject to the FORM. For matters not specified in the FORM, the provisions of the Agreement shall be considered valid and the provisions of the Agreement shall be applicable in terms of disputes arising from the implementation of the FORM.",sales_agg_no_8_p2:"This Form has been read, accepted and confirmed by the parties electronically, and the provisions of the Consumer Protection Law No. 6502 and the relevant legislation shall be apply to the matters specified in the Form.",sales_agg_no_8_p3:"THE PURCHASER ACCEPTS, DECLARES AND UNDERTAKES THAT HE/SHE HAS READ THE FORM AS PER THE ARTICLE 48 OF THE LAW NO. 6502 AND HAS GIVEN THE NECESSARY CONFIRMATION IN THE ELECTRONIC ENVIRONMENT.",sales_agg_no_8_p4:"Upon the approval of the FORM, the PURCHASER shall be deemed to have approved the start of the service by accepting all the conditions of the contract, and the FORM shall enter into force on the date of approval and shall result in payment obligation.",sales_agg_to_your_info:"To your information,",sales_agg_yours_sincerely:"Yours faithfully"},personal_data_protection_iga:{header:"CLARIFICATION TEXT FOR PROTECTION OF PERSONAL DATA PURSUANT TO THE LAW ON THE PROTECTION OF PERSONAL DATA NUMBERED 6698",basvuru_kanal_adresler:"OUR APPLICATION CHANNELS and ADDRESSES",direkt_basvuru:"Direct Application: Gayrettepe Mahallesi Vefa Bayırı Sokak No:2 Kat:3 Beşiktaş/İstanbul",telefon:"Phone: 0212 306 10 00",kep:"REM",mail:"Mail",per_data_p1:"This Clarification Text has been drawn up in accordance with the Article 10 of the Law on Protection of Personal Data No. 6698 (“Law”) titled “Clarification Obligation of the Data Controller” and “Communiqué on the Procedures and Principles to be Followed in Fulfilling the Obligation of Clarification” which aims to protect the fundamental rights and freedoms of individuals, especially the privacy of private life in the processing of personal data. In accordance with the law and relevant legislation, TTNET AŞ. (“TTNET”) takes necessary technical and administrative measures by using its technological and infrastructure facilities in order to ensure that personal data is kept securely and processed in accordance with the law, with each one being a separate data controller.",per_data_p2:"Personal data is processed by TTNET in accordance with the Law and relevant legislation under this Clarification Text. Real persons, whose personal data are processed pursuant to the Law, can learn about the personal data that can be processed by TNET, purposes of processing, recipient groups to which it can be transferred, the method of collection and the legal reason for data processing, and their rights in the Law regarding this personal data by reading the text below.",per_data_no_1:"1. PROCESSED PERSONAL DATA",per_data_no_1_p1:"Personal data refers to any information relating to an identified or identifiable person. Your processed personal data and the categories of the data are listed below.",per_data_no_1_p2:"ID Information: Name, surname and title, Passport number and inbound from",per_data_no_1_p3:"Contact Information: Telephone number, contact address, e-mail address and residential address",per_data_no_1_p4:"Processing Security Details: IP details, Password and User Name",per_data_no_1_p5:"Financial Details: Credit card details and invoice details",per_data_no_1_p6:"Marketing Details: Cookies recording",per_data_no_1_p7:"Other Information: Subscription status",per_data_no_2:"2. PURPOSES OF PROCESSING PERSONAL DATA",per_data_no_2_p1:"Your personal data may be processed for following purposes in accordance with the processing conditions provided for in Articles 5 and 6 of the Law and secondary regulations:",per_data_no_2_l1:"Conducting/Auditing Business Activities",per_data_no_2_l2:"Conducting Goods/Services Production and Operation Processes",per_data_no_2_l3:"Conducting Ads/Campaigns/Promotion Processes",per_data_no_2_l4:"Measuring customer satisfaction, making survey/analysis studies focusing on researching customer trends and increasing service quality,",per_data_no_2_l5:"Conducting Customer Relations Management Processes",per_data_no_2_l6:"Conducting Contract Processes",per_data_no_2_l7:"Conducting Emergency Management Processes",per_data_no_2_l8:"Conducting IT Security Processes",per_data_no_2_l9:"Conducting Access Authorizations",per_data_no_2_l10:"Conducting Activities in line with Legislation",per_data_no_2_l11:"Monitoring and Performing Legal Actions",per_data_no_2_l12:"Conducting Internal Audit/Investigation/Intelligence Activities",per_data_no_2_l13:"Conducting Retention and Archive Works",per_data_no_2_l14:"Creating and Following Visitor Records",per_data_no_2_l15:"Informing Public Authorities and Organizations",per_data_no_3:"3. TRANSFER OF PERSONAL DATA",per_data_no_3_p1:"Your personal data may be processed and shared between Türk Telekomünikasyon A.Ş. and TT Mobil İletişim Hizmetleri A.Ş. pursuant to the legislation listed below and the provisions of the Law on marketing purposes within the country, limited only for the purpose of providing the service. Your personal data is not shared with foreign and/or domestic third parties without your explicit consent.",per_data_no_3_l1:"Companies, business partnerships, suppliers and contractors, our representatives and dealers acting on behalf of our Company, which we have authorized,",per_data_no_3_l2:"The regulatory and supervisory authorities as well as the state institutions and organizations, which are authorized to request your personal data explicitly according to the laws that they are subjected to,",per_data_no_3_l3:"Lawyers, auditors, consultants and companies providing service to us,",per_data_no_3_l4:"Your attorneys, guardians and representatives authorized by you",per_data_no_4:"4. METHODS OF COLLECTING PERSONAL DATA AND THE LEGAL REASONS",per_data_no_4_p1:"Your personal data may be processed by obtaining via automatic forwarding / partial automatic forwarding through our website, mobile applications, consumption, call center and dealers during the establishment of our legal relation with the related parties and throughout the term of that relation.",per_data_no_4_l1:"Processing of the personal data is compulsory for the legitimate benefits of the data controller provided that your explicit consent is obtained,",per_data_no_4_l2:"It is clearly stipulated in the laws,",per_data_no_4_l3:"It is clearly stipulated in the arrangements of Electronic Communications Law No. 5809 and Turkish Commercial Law No. 6098,",per_data_no_4_l4:"It is clearly stipulated in the arrangements of the Consumer Protection Act 6502,",per_data_no_4_l5:"It is clearly stipulated in the arrangements of the Regulation of Electronic Trade 6563,",per_data_no_4_l6:"It complies with retaining, reporting, and notification obligations provided for by the legislation and official authorities,",per_data_no_4_l7:"It requires the processing of personal data of contracting parties, offers the required products and services, and complies with the criteria of the contracts concluded provided that it is directly related to the preparation or fulfillment of a contract.",per_data_no_5:"5. IF YOU WANT TO GET INTO CONTACT WITH US FOR YOUR RIGHTS AND CLAIMS",per_data_no_5_p1:"Pursuant to Article 11 of the Law titled “Rights of the person concerned”, which regulates the rights of the person concerned, determining if the application for the related requests belongs to you by Türk Telekom according to its nature and application method so that we can protect your rights, according to the conditions set out in the Communique for Procedures and Principles to Apply to Data Controller (“Communique”):",per_data_no_5_l1:"You can bring them directly to our addresses listed below, or submit them via post office or via notary public channel,",per_data_no_5_l2:"You can send it to the addresses below by using texts that can be sent and stored via registered email address (REM), secure e-signature or mobile signature.",per_data_no_5_p2:"The applications filed in this scope shall be accepted following to an identity authentication carried out by us and your request shall be concluded as soon as possible and the latest within 30 days according to the nature of the request. In case the application is replied in writing, no charge shall be applied up to 10 pages and 1 Turkish Lira may be charged for each page after 10 pages. In case where the response to the application is provided via a recording medium such as a CD and flash memory, a fee may be charged in the amount of the recording medium's price."},privacy_policy:{header:"Confidentiality",direkt_basvuru:"and you can also send your feedbacks and opinions on our website via this e-mail.",telefon:"For further information about legal conditions and confidentiality, please e-mail us at ",mail:"iletisim@turktelekom.com.tr",per_data_p1:"Any and all rights, property and interest on the texts, pictures, drawings, sound, animation, video files as well as the design, content, images, codes, algorithms, components, texts and all kinds of visuals and all similar of the site on this website (http