e Data Controller” and “Communiqué on the Procedures and Principles to be Followed in Fulfilling the Obligation of Clarification” which aims to protect the fundamental rights and freedoms of individuals, especially the privacy of private life in the processing of personal data.  In accordance with the law and relevant legislation, TÜRK TELEKOM A.Ş. (“TURK TELEKOM”) takes necessary technical and administrative measures by using its technological and infrastructure facilities in order to ensure that personal data is kept securely and processed in accordance with the law, with each one being a separate data controller.",per_data_p2:"Personal data is processed by TURK TELEKOM in accordance with the Law and relevant legislation under this Clarification Text. Real persons, whose personal data are processed pursuant to the Law, can learn about the personal data that can be processed by TNET, purposes of processing, recipient groups to which it can be transferred, the method of collection and the legal reason for data processing, and their rights in the Law regarding this personal data by reading the text below.",per_data_no_1:"1. PROCESSED PERSONAL DATA",per_data_no_1_p1:"Personal Data means any and all information relating to an identified or identifiable natural person. Your processed personal data and their categories are given below.",per_data_no_1_p2:"Identity Information: Name, surname, title",per_data_no_1_p3:"Contact Info: Phone number",per_data_no_1_p4:"Transaction Security Details: IP details, Password and User Name",per_data_no_1_p5:"Marketing Data: Cookies",per_data_no_1_p6:"Other Information: Subscription Status",per_data_no_2:"2. PURPOSES OF PROCESSING PERSONAL DATA",per_data_no_2_p1:"Your personal data may be processed in accordance with the processing terms stipulated in the articles 5 and 6 of the Law and its secondary regulations for the below-mentioned purposes: ",per_data_no_2_l1:"Conducting/Auditing Business Activities",per_data_no_2_l2:"Conducting Goods/Service Production and Operation Processes",per_data_no_2_l3:"Conducting Ads/Campaigns/Promotion Processes",per_data_no_2_l4:"Measuring customer satisfaction, making survey/analysis studies focusing on researching customer trends and increasing service quality,\n",per_data_no_2_l5:"Conducting Customer Relations Management Processes",per_data_no_2_l6:"Conducting Contract Processes",per_data_no_2_l7:"Conducting Emergency Management Processes",per_data_no_2_l8:"Conducting IT Security Processes",per_data_no_2_l9:"Conducting Access Authorizations",per_data_no_2_l10:"Conducting Activities in line with Legislation",per_data_no_2_l11:"Monitoring and Performing Legal Actions",per_data_no_2_l12:"Conducting Internal Audit/Investigation/Intelligence Activities",per_data_no_2_l13:"Conducting Retention and Archive Works",per_data_no_2_l14:"Creating and Following Visitor Records",per_data_no_2_l15:"Informing Public Authorities and Organizations",per_data_no_3:"3. TRANSFER OF PERSONAL DATA",per_data_no_3_p1:"Your personal data may be processed and shared between Türk Telekomünikasyon A.Ş. and TT Mobil İletişim Hizmetleri A.Ş. pursuant to the legislation listed below and the provisions of the Law on the transfer of personal data within the country, limited only for the purpose of providing the service. Your personal data is not shared with foreign and/or domestic third parties without your explicit consent.",per_data_no_3_l1:"Companies, business partnerships, suppliers and contractors, our representatives and dealers acting on behalf of our Company, which we have authorized,",per_data_no_3_l2:"The regulatory and supervisory authorities as well as the state institutions and organizations, which are authorized to request your personal data explicitly according to the laws that they are subjected to,",per_data_no_3_l3:"Lawyers, auditors, consultants and companies providing service to us,",per_data_no_3_l4:"Your attorneys, guardians and representatives authorized by you",per_data_no_