URPOSE YOUR PERSONAL DATA WILL BE PROCESSED",per_data_no_3_p1:"Your personal data is processed by the Company for the following purposes, based on your explicit consent or in other cases legally permitted under the Law:",per_data_no_3_l1:"Providing internet access to visitors (credential information, contact information, transaction security information), (Legal Reason: Legitimate interest)",per_data_no_3_l2:"The Company's fulfillment of its legal obligations (identity information, contact information, transaction security information) pursuant to the Law No. 5651 on Regulating Broadcasts Made on the Internet and Combating Crimes Committed Through These Broadcasts, (Legal reason: clearly stipulated in the laws)",per_data_no_3_l3:"Carrying out the processes of providing information to authorized institutions and organizations (identity information, contact information, transaction security information), (Legal Reason: It is clearly stipulated in the laws)",per_data_no_4:"4. THE PARTIES TO WHICH YOUR PERSONAL DATA IS TRANSFERRED AND THE PURPOSE OF TRANSFER",per_data_no_4_p1:"Your personal data, in cases where the Law expressly allows (within the scope of legal reasons specified in Section 2) and/or based on your explicit consent (and within the framework of the purposes specified in Section 3), in the country and abroad; It can transfer and/or make it accessible to our third party business partners, suppliers (cloud computing, data processing support companies, etc.) who provide support in other areas related to the Company's activities, to legally authorized institutions and organizations in order to resolve legal disputes and fulfill obligations arising from legislation. .",per_data_no_5:"5. YOUR RIGHTS AS PERSONAL DATA SUBJECT STATED IN ARTICLE 11 OF THE LAW",per_data_no_5_p1:"As a personal data owner, we declare that you have the following rights in accordance with Article 11 of the Law:",per_data_no_5_l1:"Learning whether your personal data is processed,",per_dat