an learn about the personal data that can be processed by TNET, purposes of processing, recipient groups to which it can be transferred, the method of collection and the legal reason for data processing, and their rights in the Law regarding this personal data by reading the text below.",per_data_no_1:"1. PROCESSED PERSONAL DATA",per_data_no_1_p1:"Personal data refers to any information relating to an identified or identifiable person. Your processed personal data and the categories of the data are listed below.",per_data_no_1_p2:"Identity Information: Name, surname, title",per_data_no_1_p3:"Contact Info: Phone number",per_data_no_1_p4:"Transaction Security Information: IP information, Password and Username",per_data_no_1_p5:"Marketing Information: Cookie registration",per_data_no_1_p6:"Other Information: Subscription status",per_data_no_2:"2. PURPOSES OF PROCESSING PERSONAL DATA",per_data_no_2_p1:"Your personal data may be processed for following purposes in accordance with the processing conditions provided for in Articles 5 and 6 of the Law and secondary regulations:",per_data_no_2_l1:"Execution / Supervision of Business Activities",per_data_no_2_l2:"Execution of Goods / Services Production and Operation Processes",per_data_no_2_l3:"Conducting Ads/Campaigns/Promotion Processes",per_data_no_2_l4:"Conducting surveys/analysis studies focused on measuring customer satisfaction, researching customer trends and increasing service quality",per_data_no_2_l5:"Conducting Customer Relations Management Processes",per_data_no_2_l6:"Conducting Contract Processes",per_data_no_2_l7:"Execution of Emergency Management Processes",per_data_no_2_l8:"Conducting IT Security Processes",per_data_no_2_l9:"Conducting Access Authorizations",per_data_no_2_l10:"Conducting Activities in line with Legislation",per_data_no_2_l11:"Monitoring and Performing Legal Actions",per_data_no_2_l12:"Conducting Internal Audit/Investigation/Intelligence Activities",per_data_no_2_l13:"Conducting Retention and Archive Works",per_data_no_2_l14:"Creating and Tracking Visitor Records",per_data_no_2_l15:"Providing Information to Official Institutions and Organizations",per_data_no_3:"3. TRANSFER OF PERSONAL DATA",per_data_no_3_p1:"Your personal data may be processed and shared between Türk Telekomünikasyon A.Ş. and TT Mobil İletişim Hizmetleri A.Ş. pursuant to the legislation listed below and the provisions of the Law on marketing purposes within the country, limited only for the purpose of providing the service. Your personal data is not shared with foreign and/or domestic third parties without your explicit consent.",per_data_no_3_l1:"Companies, business partnerships, suppliers and contractors, our representatives and dealers acting on behalf of our Company, which we have authorized,",per_data_no_3_l2:"The regulatory and supervisory authorities as well as the state institutions and organizations, which are authorized to request your personal data explicitly according to the laws that they are subjected to,",per_data_no_3_l3:"Lawyers, auditors, consultants and companies providing service to us,",per_data_no_3_l4:"Your attorneys, guardians and representatives authorized by you",per_data_no_4:"4. METHODS OF COLLECTING PERSONAL DATA AND THE LEGAL REASONS",per_data_no_4_p1:"Your personal data may be processed by obtaining via automatic forwarding / partial automatic forwarding through our website, mobile applications, consumption, call center and dealers during the establishment of our legal relation with the related parties and throughout the term of that relation.",per_data_no_4_l1:"You have given your express consent,",per_data_no_4_l2:"It is clearly stipulated in the laws,",per_data_no_4_l3:"It is clearly stipulated in the arrangements of Electronic Communications Law No. 5809 and Turkish Commercial Law No. 6098,",per_data_no_4_l4:"It is clearly stipulated in the arrangements of the Consumer Protection Act 6502,",per_data_no_4_l5:"It is clearly stipulated in the arrangements of the Regulation of Electronic Trade 6563,",per_data_no_4_l6:"It complies with retaining, reporting, and notification obligations provided for by the legislation and official authorities,",per_data_no_4_l7:"It requires the processing of personal data of contracting parties, offers the required products and services, and complies with the criteria of the contracts concluded provided that it is directly related to the preparation or fulfillment of a contract.",per_data_no_5:"5. IF YOU WANT TO GET INTO CONTACT WITH US FOR YOUR RIGHTS AND CLAIMS",per_data_no_5_p1:"Pursuant to Article 11 of the Law titled “Rights of the person concerned”, which regulates the rights of the person concerned, determining if the application for the related requests belongs to you by Türk Telekom according to its nature and application method so that we can protect your rights, according to the conditions set out in the Communique for Procedures and Principles to Apply to Data Controller (“Communique”):",per_data_no_5_l1:"You can bring them directly to our addresses listed below, or submit them via post office or via notary public channel,",per_data_no_5_l2:"You can send it to the addresses below by using texts that can be sent and stored via registered email address (REM), secure e-signature or mobile signature.",per_data_no_5_p2:"The applications filed in this scope shall be accepted following to an identity authentication carried out by us and your request shall be concluded as soon as possible and the latest within 30 days according to the nature of the request. In case the application is replied in writing, no charge shall be applied up to 10 pages and 1 Turkish Lira may be charged for each page after 10 pages. In case where the response to the application is provided via a recording medium such as a CD and flash memory, a fee may be charged in the amount of the recording medium's price."},internet_usage_terms:{header:"PLEASdddE READ THIS AGREEMENT CAREFULLY.",content:'THIS AGREEMENT 