 medium or platform providers of OPERATOR. <br> <br> The USER accepts not to change, adapt, translate, sell any element of the contents provided with or through Türk Telekom WIFI; not to create derivative or processed works by using these contents/products/services, not to distort the order of these contents/services, not to use the contents, images, clips, musical pieces or composition, or lyrics and compositions that it uses within the scope of this service for purposes other than set forth herein, not to change, or reverse-engineer them in a way that will distort the integrity thereof, and not to attempt to publish them in any media. <br> <br> The USER accepts not to remove, hide or change the rights and copyrights, trademarks or other registered rights of OPERATOR or any third parties who have rights on the work including content, medium or platform providers of OPERATOR within the scope of Türk Telekom WIFI portal or in relation to Türk Telekom WIFI service. <br> <br> The USER hereby agrees that he/she will protect the confidential information he/she acquires, at the time of use of Türk Telekom WIFI, regarding the system or regarding OPERATOR or third parties who have rights on the contents including content, medium and platform providers of OPERATOR, which information are outside the purpose of use of Türk Telekom WIFI. The USER agrees not to disclose this confidential information, directly or indirectly, to any third parties, either in part or in whole. <br> <br> In the event of failure of the USER to fulfil his/her undertakings and liabilities set out in this article, the USER shall be solely responsible for the claims of third persons and companies, and it will be obligated to meet all kinds of expenses claimed by third parties, including but not limited to the licensors in relation to the work and contents, by reason of the damages they incurred, including but not limited to court expenses and attorney’s fees. <br> <br> All the rights of OPERATOR in relati