programs and operating systems necessary for monitoring and/or tapping of the images, sounds and all other types of contents through the agency of Türk Telekom WIFI are required, and for obtaining such permits and licenses. <br> <br> The USER irrevocably and unconditionally declares, accepts and undertakes that all the responsibility arising out of his/her use of Türk Telekom WIFI in violation of the provisions of this agreement shall be borne by himself/herself, and that he/she will be individually responsible for any loss or damage and lawsuits and claims for loss and damage that may be initiated by third parties as a result of such use, that OPERATOR shall not be a party to, and be involved in these kinds of lawsuits, complaints and similar issues, that if OPERATOR is considered a party in any lawsuits that may be initiated by third parties and is put under any liability or obligation to pay indemnity to third parties by reason of violation of the terms of this AGREEMENT by the USER, OPERATOR will be entitled to take recourse against the USER for all kinds of damages it may incur, particularly the indemnity it has paid, and that, upon request of OPERATOR, he/she will pay OPERATOR the indemnities, damages and expenses that have been paid, all at once. <br> <br> <br> <strong>7. DATA APPLICATIONS AND CONFIDENTIALITY</strong><br> <br> The USER shall be responsible for the accuracy, security, safekeeping of the username, password, Türk Telekom service number, Türk Telekom username and Türk Telekom password which are entered by the USER for user verification at the time of access to Türk Telekom WIFI, and for not revealing them to third parties, and for all matters regarding their use. OPERATOR shall not be responsible for the errors in the data that are entered and/or access to Türk Telekom WIFI in the name of the USER by others who have acquired/learnt the USER information. OPERATOR has no direct or indirect responsibility for damages that are or may be incurred by the USER and/or third parties for reasons relating to security, safekeeping, confidentiality and use of the tools of access to Türk Telekom WIFI (username and password). Within this context, the USER cannot make any claims for damages or indemnities from OPERATOR, under any name whatsoever. <br> <br> OPERATOR’s Confidentiality Policy concerning safekeeping of personal information is available at <a href="http://bireysel.turktelekom.com.tr/evde-internet/web/Hakkinda/Sayfalar/Gizlilik-ve-Guvenlik.aspx " target="_blank" style="background: #FFFFFF; color: #1ba3ac; font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;">bireysel.turktelekom.com.tr/evde-internet/web/Hakkinda/Sayfalar/Gizlilik-ve-Guvenlik.aspx</a>. We , as OPERATOR, recommend that you read this Confidentiality Policy carefully. The USER accepts and undertakes to keep confidential any information it may acquire regarding this agreement, and consequently, OPERATOR, for an indefinite period of time, regardless of the termination of this agreement for any reason whatsoever. <br> <br> <br> <strong>8. CONNECTION AND ACCESIBILITY</strong><br> <br> The USER may access Türk Telekom WIFI by using a personal computer via DSL, ISDN and other connection methods. The USER is responsible for providing the equipment that is suitable for access to Türk Telekom WIFI. OPERATOR shall not be responsible for the limited functions/images. <br> <br> OPERATOR uses all the technical possibilities in order to make Türk Telekom WIFI continuously accessible. However, Türk Telekom WIFI may not be accessible due to problems which are not caused by OPERATOR, due to network maintenance and repair operations, operational failures and problems arising from other operators’ networks (force majeure reasons, third parties’ fault, etc.), at times of routine maintenance and version upgrades. OPERATOR shall not be responsible if there is no access to Türk Telekom WIFI or if it cannot be accessed as required, for the reasons specified above. The USER cannot claim any expenses, indemnities or any other costs under any name whatsoever. OPERATOR has the right to restrict, at any time, the access to Türk Telekom WIFI with an aim to protect the user information, network security and the Türk Telekom WIFI software. <br> <br> <br> <strong>9. AMENDMENTS TO THE AGREEMENT</strong><br> <br> OPERATOR may amend this agreement at any time it may deem appropriate at its own discretion and unilaterally. The amended provisions of this agreement shall become effective on the date they are posted on the relevant web page or welcome page in relation to Türk Telekom WIFI. The USER shall be deemed to have accepted the amendments to this agreement, after they are posted on the website in relation to Türk Telekom WIFI. We recommend that you frequently check this Agreement in order to be fully informed of such amendments. The remaining provisions shall continue to be in full force and effect. This agreement cannot be amended by way of unilateral statements of the USER. <br> <br> <br> <strong>10. FORCE MAJEURE REASONS</strong><br> <br> OPERATOR shall not be responsible for any delay or default in performing the obligations specified hereunder if such delay or default is caused by force majeure circumstances. These and similar circumstances shall not be deemed as delay, failure or default in performance for OPERATOR, and no claims can be made against OPERATOR in such circumstances. The term “force majeure” shall be construed as incidents which are beyond the reasonable control of, and which cannot be avoided by, OPERATOR in spite of the necessary care it has shown, including but not limited to natural disasters, riots, wars, strikes, communication problems, infrastructure and internet failures, power cut-offs and restrictions applied by authorised institutions and adverse weather conditions. <br> <br> <br> <strong>11. MISCELLANEOUS PROVISIONS</strong><br> <br> This agreement, its implementation, interpretation, management and settlement of the dispute arising hereunder shall be subject to Turkish law. Parties accept that the disputes that may arise out of implementation of this agreement shall be settled by the central courts and execution offices of Istanbul.<br> <br> In the event that the authorized court deems any of the provisions or part of this agreement unenforceable as a result of any lawsuit, the remainder of this AGREEMENT shall continue to be in full force and effect. <br> <br> OPERATOR may, at its own discretion, transfer and assign its obligations and rights within the scope of this agreement to others, either in part or in whole, or conclude subcontracts in relation to such rights and obligations. Waivers of any rights concerning breach of any provisions of this agreement or defaults within the scope of this agreement shall not be effective unless they are made in writing and signed by the party waiving such right. Waiver of any breach or default shall not be construed as a continuing waiver of any subsequent breaches or defaults. <br> <br> The records of OPERATOR shall serve as basis to the disputes between the parties. The USER agrees that in any disputes that may arise from the implementation of this agreement, the commercial books and records, computer records, e-mails, microfilms, voice recordings, invoice data and all kinds of documents of OPERATOR shall serve as valid, binding and definite evidence, and that it holds harmless OPERATOR from offers for oath and that this article shall constitute the evidence agreement specified in Article 287 of the Civil Procedure Law. <br> <br> <br> <strong>12. DATE OF EFFECT OF THE AGREEMENT AND TERMINATION</strong><br> <br> The USER shall be deemed to accept the conditions of this AGREEMENT and this AGREEMENT shall enter into force between the parties for an indefinite period of time at the moment when the USER declares his/her acceptance by clicking on the relevant menu in the electronic environment. <br> <br> The USER accepts and undertakes to promptly indemnify any and all damages and losses that may be incurred by OPERATOR and/or third parties as a result of his/her acts in violation of the rights and obligations specified in the agreement and as a result of his/her failure to fulfil his/her obligations and undertakings, as of the moment he/she accepts this AGREEMENT. <br> <br> This agreement and the right of the USER to use Türk Telekom WIFI pursuant to this AGREEMENT shall become null and void, without the need to serve any notices, when (a) the USER ceases his/her use of Türk Telekom WIFI and terminates his/her subscription in compliance with the instructions relating to the termination of subscription, (b) any conditions of termination specified in the agreement occur, (c) the subscription agreement between the USER and OPERATOR is terminated for any reason whatsoever. <br> <br> OPERATOR reserves the right to terminate, at any time, this agreement, and the authorization of the USER to use Türk Telekom WIFI without serving any prior notice.'},preInformationIga:{pre_info_no_1:"Dear Our Turk Telekom WIFI Customer,",pre_info_no_1_p1:"You may find below the pre-information form in detail for the service pursuant to your request to buy a package prepaid by credit card. Please read the following texts carefully and proceed with ticking the box ''I received, red and accepted the pre-information form'' which you see at your buying.  You may receive any and all support by calling the Customer Services through 444 0 145. Thank you for your choosing Turk Telekom WIFI.",pre_info_no_2:"Turk Telekom WIFI PRE-INFORMATION FORM",pre_info_no_2_p1:"You may get connected to Internet freely by Turk Telekom WIFI over thousands service points out of home and workplace through your laptop or WIFI compatible cellular phone.",pre_info_no_2_p2:"You may use Turk Telekom WIFI prepaid packages until its expiration of its term after its initial use.",pre_info_no_2_p3:"You may buy by your credit card Turk Telekom WIFI packages applicable in various time zones to get connected to Internet from Turk Telekom WIFI service points.",pre_info_no_2_p4:"Prepaid package chosen Turk Telekom WIFI:",pre_info_no_2_p5:"kullanım hakkı içeren, kullanıcının ilk kullanımından itibaren 1 gün süreyle geçerli olan, tek sefer kullanımlık TTNET WiFi servis bileşenidir, ücreti vergiler dahil",pre_info_no_2_p6:"To get connected to Turk Telekom WIFI; ",pre_info_no_2_p7:"Open WIFI property of your device at the wireless Internet service point where you see Turk Telekom WIFI name and logo.",pre_info_no_2_p8:"Choose ''Turk Telekom WIFI'' among the wireless networks (SSID).",pre_info_no_2_p9:"You will be directed automatically to the welcome page when you try to go to any page through your web browser downloaded in your computer.",pre_info_no_2_p10:"Start to use Turk Telekom WIFI by entering your TTNET User Name and Password in the page appeared on your screen or by completing authentication proceedings. ",pre_info_no_2_p11_a:"You can reach to Turk Telekom WIFI Service Points List through Turk Telekom WIFI Service Points Menu in the web page at ",pre_info_no_2_p11_b:"",pre_info_no_2_p12:"To get further information on Turk Telekom WIFI please",pre_info_no_2_p13:"You may get information on Turk Telekom WIFI with calling TTNET Customer Services at 444 0 145 or visiting the nearest Turk Telekom Office.",pre_info_no_2_p14:"Need-To-Know on Turk Telekom WIFI",pre_info_no_2_p15:"The products and/or services you will purchase can be supplied through online shopping by payment with credit card. The printed invoice of the aforementioned prices of this service will be sent to the street address you stated in your request if you require at your application. You don't need to make payment for the invoice as prepaid by credit card. The prices changed subject to any increase or decrease in costs and other economic factors arisen from the economic changes or legal amendments in supply process of the products and/or services you will purchase shall be reflected to the price lists. TTNET shall be entitled to make change in the price list anytime at advance notice including but not limited to those.",pre_info_no_2_p16:"Bu servisten ön ödemeli bir paket alarak faydalanabilirsiniz.",pre_info_no_2_p17:"Turk Telekom WIFI Prepaid Packages are the packages which all the users whether or not TTNET Subscriber may use to take advantage of Turk Telekom WIFI Wireless Internet access service.",pre_info_no_2_p18:"Internet access can be provided by the packages purchased at the price paid for once only for prescribed time period at Turk Telekom WIFI service points.",pre_info_no_2_p19:"There is no physical delivery of this service.  You may get access to the service you purchased with the user name and password you assigned at the time you applied.",pre_info_no_2_p20:"The products/services you purchased are in the scope of the services for which no right of withdrawal can be exercised pursuant to the Customer Protection Law No. 6502 and items (g) and (h) of Article 15 of the Distant Agreements Regulation.",pre_info_no_2_p21:"Turk Telekom WIFI Prepaid Packages are the services supplied by TTNET A.S. and Mersis number of TTNET A.S. is : 0859049187200014, its address: Gayrettepe Mahallesi Vefa Bayırı Sokak No:2 Kat:3 Beşiktaş/İstanbul; telephone number 0 212 306 10 00. You may convey your queries, complaints and objections to aforementioned address as well as you may call the Customer Services number 0 212 444 0 145. In addition, within the limits set by the Ministry in December of every year, you may file your applications regarding your complaints and objections with the arbitration committee for customer problems or the customer court located at the region where you purchased the good or service or where you domicile. ",tiklayiniz:"click here..."},sales_agg_iga:{sales_agg_header:"PRE-NOTIFICATION FORM AND DISTANT SALES AGREEMENT",sayin:"Dear",unvani:"TITLE",mernis_no:"CRS NO",adres:"ADDRESS",telefon:"PHONE",