number and the password received from the kiosk, and confirms the terms of use to start using the package.",sales_agg_no_3_p3:"The Purchaser can use the selected package from the first use until the end of the validity period of the package.",sales_agg_no_4:"4. PAYMENT AND DELIVERY:",sales_agg_no_4_p1:"Once the PURCHASER reads the information about the service purchased and confirms this FORM, the service sale shall be completed. Subsequently, the purchased service shall be defined at the time of request and the PURCHASER shall be able to use the service based on the identification without the need for any further action.",sales_agg_no_4_p2:"The purchased service shall not be delivered in any physical form.",sales_agg_no_4_p3:"Fee for the product or service subject to the form shall be collected by credit card via payment service providers operating within the framework of the relevant law. In the event that the service fee subject to the FORM is not paid for any reason and/or it is canceled in the records of the bank, financial institution, the OPERATOR/SELLER’s obligation to deliver/perform the Service/Product subject to the FORM shall expire.",sales_agg_no_4_p4:"The invoice of the package fee in this form shall be submitted to the PURCHASER’s contact address.",sales_agg_no_5:"5. RIGHT OF WITHDRAWAL",sales_agg_no_5_p1:"As the package subject to this form is within the scope of services that are carried out instantly electronically in accordance with the Articles 15 (ğ) and (h) of the Law on Consumer Protection No. 6502 and Regulation on Distance Contracts and/or started to be performed with the consent of the consumer before the expiry of the right of withdrawal, the Purchaser/consumer has no right of withdrawal.",sales_agg_no_6:"6. SOLUTION MECHANISM FOR CUSTOMER COMPLAINTS:",sales_agg_no_6_p1:"Queries, requests and complaints about the purchased product/tariff/package/transaction/service can be directed to the above address or to Türk Telekom Customer Service at 444 0 145.",sales_agg_no_6_p2:"Applications for complaints and objections can be made to the Consumer Arbitration Committee or the Consumer Court in the place where the product or service is purchased or resident, within the monetary limits announced by the Ministry of Commerce in December each year.",sales_agg_no_7:"7. PERSONAL DATA PROTECTION",sales_agg_no_7_p1:"The OPERATOR accepts, declares and undertakes that it is obliged to act in accordance with all regulations, rules and principles in force regarding the protection of Personal Data, particularly Article 51 of the Electronic Communications Law No. 5809, Law on the Protection of Personal Data No. 6698 (“KVKK”) and secondary regulations and Board decisions and guidelines. In terms of all its activities related to the processing of personal data obtained from the PURCHASER or obtained on behalf of the other party during the performance of this Agreement, the OPERATOR accepts, declares and undertakes that it shall be subject to all kinds of the current national legislation in the field of personal data protection, in particular KVKK, and shall have statutory liability to comply with this legislation in transaction processes. In addition, it agrees, declares and undertakes that it shall also comply with the principles set forth in the Board Decisions and Guidelines to be published by the Personal Data Protection Board ('Board') within the scope of personal data legislation.",sales_agg_no_7_p2:"PURCHASER agrees to the collection, processing and use of her/his Personal Data for statistical, administrative and accounting purposes to the extent that it is necessary for the OPERATOR to provide services, as well as conducting research on the market, behaviors and preferences, marketing activities such as advertising, targeted advertising, campaigns, offers, gifts, promotions, publicity, celebrations, prizes, lottery, and diversification of products and services, performance measurement/rating operations, conducting business development and communication activities, adapting the OPERATOR's presentation to the expectations of the PURCHASERS, increasing the quality of services, creating a collective image for PURCHASERS and advertising.",sales_agg_no_7_p3:"All these Personal Data belonging to PURCHASER shall be processed, stored and used for the purposes specified in the Clarification Text in accordance with the Personal Data Protection Law, the relevant regulations and, in any case, the Clarification Text on the OPERATOR's Website",sales_agg_no_8:"8. MISCELLANEOUS",sales_agg_no_8_p1:"This FORM is an integral part and annex to the Agreement (End-User License Agreement) regarding the service subject to the FORM. For matters not specified in the FORM, the provisions of the Agreement shall be considered valid and the provisions of the Agreement shall be applicable in terms of disputes arising from the implementation of the FORM.",sales_agg_no_8_p2:"This Form has been read, accepted and confirmed by the parties electronically, and the provisions of the Consumer Protection Law No. 6502 and the relevant legislation shall be apply to the matters specified in the Form.",sales_agg_no_8_p3:"THE PURCHASER ACCEPTS, DECLARES AND UNDERTAKES THAT HE/SHE HAS READ THE FORM AS PER THE ARTICLE 48 OF THE LAW NO. 6502 AND HAS GIVEN THE NECESSARY CONFIRMATION IN THE ELECTRONIC ENVIRONMENT.",sales_agg_no_8_p4:"Upon the approval of the FORM, the PURCHASER shall be deemed to have approved the start of the service by accepting all the conditions of the contract, and the FORM shall enter into force on the date of approval and shall result in payment obligation.",sales_agg_to_your_info:"To your information,",sales_agg_yours_sincerely:"Yours faithfully"},personal_data_protection_iga:{header:"CLARIFICATION TEXT FOR PROTECTION OF PERSONAL DATA PURSUANT TO THE LAW ON THE PROTECTION OF PERSONAL DATA NUMBERED 6698",basvuru_kanal_adresler:"OUR APPLICATION CHANNELS and ADDRESSES",direkt_basvuru:"Direct Application: Gayrettepe Mahallesi Vefa Bayırı Sokak No:2 Kat:3 Beşiktaş/İstanbul",telefon:"Phone: 0212 306 10 00",kep:"REM",mail:"Mail",per_data_p1:"This Clarification Text has been drawn up in accordance with the Article 10 of the Law on Protection of Personal Data No. 6698 (“Law”) titled “Clarification Obligation of the Data Controller” and “Communiqué on the Procedures and Principles to be Followed in Fulfilling the Obligation of Clarification” which aims to protect the fundamental rights and freedoms of individuals, especially the privacy of private life in the processing of personal data. In accordance with the law and relevant legislation, TTNET AŞ. (“TTNET”) takes necessary technical and administrative measures by using its technological and infrastructure facilities in order to ensure that personal data is kept securely and processed in accordance with the law, with each one being a separate data controller.",per_data_p2:"Personal data is processed by TTNET in accordance with the Law and relevant legislation under this Clarification Text. Real persons, whose personal data are processed pursuant to the Law, can learn about the personal data that can be processed by TNET, purposes of processing, recipient groups to which it can be transferred, the method of collection and the legal reason for data processing, and their rights in the Law regarding this personal data by reading the text below.",per_data_no_1:"1. PROCESSED PERSONAL DATA",per_data_no_1_p1:"Personal data refers to any information relating to an identified or identifiable person. Your processed personal data and the categories of the data are listed below.",per_data_no_1_p2:"ID Information: Name, surname and title, Passport number and inbound from",per_data_no_1_p3:"Contact Information: Telephone number, contact address, e-mail address and residential address",per_data_no_1_p4:"Processing Security Details: IP details, Password and User Name",per_data_no_1_p5:"Financial Details: Credit card details and invoice det