r Company, which we have authorized,",per_data_no_3_l2:"The regulatory and supervisory authorities as well as the state institutions and organizations, which are authorized to request your personal data explicitly according to the laws that they are subjected to,",per_data_no_3_l3:"Lawyers, auditors, consultants and companies providing service to us,",per_data_no_3_l4:"Your attorneys, guardians and representatives authorized by you",per_data_no_4:"4. METHODS OF COLLECTING PERSONAL DATA AND THE LEGAL REASONS",per_data_no_4_p1:"Your personal data may be processed by obtaining via automatic forwarding / partial automatic forwarding through our website, mobile applications, consumption, call center and dealers during the establishment of our legal relation with the related parties and throughout the term of that relation.",per_data_no_4_l1:"Processing of the personal data is compulsory for the legitimate benefits of the data controller provided that your explicit consent is obtained,",per_data_no_4_l2:"It is clearly stipulated in the laws,",per_data_no_4_l3:"It is clearly stipulated in the arrangements of Electronic Communications Law No. 5809 and Turkish Commercial Law No. 6098,",per_data_no_4_l4:"It is clearly stipulated in the arrangements of the Consumer Protection Act 6502,",per_data_no_4_l5:"It is clearly stipulated in the arrangements of the Regulation of Electronic Trade 6563,",per_data_no_4_l6:"It complies with retaining, reporting, and notification obligations provided for by the legislation and official authorities,",per_data_no_4_l7:"It requires the processing of personal data of contracting parties, offers the required products and services, and complies with the criteria of the contracts concluded provided that it is directly related to the preparation or fulfillment of a contract.",per_data_no_5:"5. IF YOU WANT TO GET INTO CONTACT WITH US FOR YOUR RIGHTS AND CLAIMS",per_data_no_5_p1:"Pursuant to Article 11 of the Law titled “Rights of the person concerned